  <content>
  <section><title>Warm Up Activity</title>

<div class="os-raise-familysupport">
  <para>Access the <link url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/ad776e2f4b03a08bf69ddddc59a1efd31551b1a0">Desmos guide PDF</link> for tips on solving problems with the Desmos graphing calculator.</para>
</div>
<para>Graph each inequality. Adjust the graphing window as needed to show meaningful information.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( y &gt; x \) using the Desmos tool below. </item>
</list>
<div class="os-raise-ib-desmos-gc" data-schema-version="1.0"/>
<example><exercise>
  <problem> 
    
    <!--QUESTION IS OUTSIDE OF INTERACTION DUE TO DESMOS--> 
    
  <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work. </para>
  </problem><solution>
  <para>Example:</para>
  <para>\(y &gt; x\)</para>
  <div><image alt="Graph of inequality. " class="img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom" height="300" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/9b2394b2bbdb6d8219b8c05a64654db70d051985" width="300"/></div>
</solution></exercise>
</example><!--Q2-->
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item> Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( y \geq x \) using the Desmos tool below. </item>
</list>
<div class="os-raise-ib-desmos-gc" data-schema-version="1.0"/>
<example><exercise>
  <problem> 
    
    
    <!--QUESTION IS OUTSIDE OF INTERACTION DUE TO DESMOS--> 
  <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work. </para>
  </problem><solution>
  <para>Example:</para>
  <para>\( y \geq x \)</para>
  <div><image alt="Graph of inequality. " class="img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom" height="300" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/be150cd9ebf2f78467309cde21dfe489e7cd308a" width="300"/></div>
</solution></exercise>
</example><!--Q3-->
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( y&lt;\text-8 \) using the Desmos tool below. </item>
